[
  {
    "id": "sub_01",
    "start": 0.2,
    "end": 3.4,
    "text": "Instagram, social comparison...\nAll we know about media.",
    "highlight": "social comparison"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_02",
    "start": 3.6,
    "end": 6.5,
    "text": "When book came out in 2024,\nwhat I realized is:",
    "highlight": "what I realized"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_03",
    "start": 6.7,
    "end": 10.2,
    "text": "that I vastly underestimated\nthe damage!",
    "highlight": "vastly underestimated"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_04",
    "start": 10.4,
    "end": 13.6,
    "text": "Because I focused on mental\nhealth, which is catastrophic...",
    "highlight": "mental health"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_05",
    "start": 13.8,
    "end": 17.6,
    "text": "But the bigger damage is\ndestruction of human attention.",
    "highlight": "destruction of human attention"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_06",
    "start": 17.8,
    "end": 21.6,
    "text": "Without ability to pay attention\nfor several minutes...",
    "highlight": "ability to pay attention"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_07",
    "start": 21.8,
    "end": 24.8,
    "text": "ideally 10 or 20 minutes\nat a time...",
    "highlight": "10 or 20 minutes"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_08",
    "start": 25.0,
    "end": 28.4,
    "text": "Without that, you won't be\nof use as employee.",
    "highlight": "as an employee"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_09",
    "start": 28.6,
    "end": 31.0,
    "text": "You won't be of use\nas a spouse.",
    "highlight": "as a spouse"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_10",
    "start": 31.2,
    "end": 33.6,
    "text": "You will not be\nsuccessful in life.",
    "highlight": "successful in life"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_11",
    "start": 33.8,
    "end": 37.6,
    "text": "And that's when I realized:\nthis is beyond mental health.",
    "highlight": "beyond mental health"
  },
  {
    "id": "sub_12",
    "start": 37.8,
    "end": 42.4,
    "text": "This is changing human cognition,\non a global scale!",
    "highlight": "on a global scale"
  }
]
